## Iridium 1.0.18 - External Nodes Table UI Improvements

### Changed
- Simplified External Nodes table: removed OBFS, Insecure, PIN SHA256 columns
- Added compact badges (OBFS, Insecure, Pinned) in the Name column
- Added horizontal scroll for tables on smaller screens
- Improved table responsiveness

### Fixed
- Table no longer overflows on narrow screens
